published research of:
  - OpenJTD  https://github.com/KimEJ/OpenJTD   (Apache-2.0), RFC 0001-0009
  - Tika-JTD https://github.com/KHiyowa/Tika-JTD (Apache-2.0), RFC 0001-0011
No code was copied from those projects; findings are cited in docs/spec.

